## 7. Frontend implementation

### 7.1 Data layer

| File | Role |
|---|---|
| `src/lib/api/admin.ts` | Fetch client: `credentials: "include"`, CSRF header, typed responses |
| `src/components/admin/users/UsersProvider.tsx` | Starts empty; loads `/api/admin/users`; `addUser` calls the API and returns the activation path |
| `src/components/admin/ReferenceDataProvider.tsx` | Loads specialties, departments and locations once for forms and filters |
| `src/lib/role-home.ts` | Single role → destination mapping |

### 7.2 Pages and components

| Area | Change |
|---|---|
| `/admin/users` | Live rows and stats; loading/error states; "Demo data" badge removed |
| `/admin/users/new` | Specialty/department/location from the database; doctor department follows the specialty; one-time link shown after creation |
| `/admin/doctors-staff` | Live directory; loading/error/empty states |
| Doctor/staff detail pages | Fetch by id; verification buttons; invitation actions |
| `/activate` *(new)* | Consumes the one-time token and sets a password |
| `/workspace` *(new)* | Guarded destination for doctor/staff accounts |

### 7.3 Lifecycle actions wired

| Action | Endpoint | UI |
|---|---|---|
| Change status | `PATCH /users/:id/status` | Row menu → dialog with allowed transitions and a mandatory reason |
| Resend invitation / reset password | `POST /users/:id/invitations` | Quick Actions + header menu → one-time link dialog |
| Verify / reject licence | `POST /doctors-staff/:id/verification` | Verification card → two buttons |

Shared components: `ActionDialog` (focus trap, Escape, scroll lock, focus restore),
`ChangeStatusDialog`, `OneTimeLinkDialog`.

### 7.4 Reference data replaces hardcoded lists

| Surface | Before | After |
|---|---|---|
| Specialty | 8 hardcoded names | 12 active specialties |
| Doctor department | 8 hardcoded names | clinical departments, narrowed to the specialty |
| Staff department | 9 hardcoded names | all 15 departments |
| Work location | free text (failed unless exact) | select of 3 clinic locations |
| Directory filters | 11 departments / 3 locations | database lists |

