## 12. Known gaps and next steps

| # | Gap | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | No mailer | Activation and reset links are shown once to the administrator; a mailer is required before production |
| 2 | No doctor/staff clinical workspace | `/workspace` is an honest placeholder |
| 3 | `duty`, `nextShift`, `availability` empty | Source is the scheduling stage (`006`) |
| 4 | Photo upload not persisted | `photoUrl` is always null; the UI uses initials |
| 5 | Activity tab does not read `audit_logs` | Data is written; no read endpoint yet |
| 6 | Server-side pagination | Lists return up to 2,000 rows; pages paginate client-side |
| 7 | Rate limiting behind the Next proxy | All traffic shares one bucket (`SEC-001`) |

The documented next migration is `006_scheduling_and_care_access.sql` (appointments, availability,
time off, care relationships), which would also let the directory populate availability and duty.

